# Web performance

Targets are **guides**—tune to product class.

## Core Web Vitals (targets)

| Metric | Target |
|--------|--------|
| LCP | under 2.5s |
| INP | under 200ms |
| CLS | under 0.1 |

## Bundle sanity (gzip ballparks — adjust)

| Surface | Rough JS ceiling | Rough CSS ceiling |
|---------|------------------|-------------------|
| Marketing | ~150 KB | ~30 KB |
| App shell | ~300 KB | ~50 KB |

## Loading

Critical CSS only when justified; preload **hero media + critical font subset** sparingly; `import()` heavy deps.

```ts
const mod = await import("heavy-chart-lib");
```

## Images

Explicit **`width`** / **`height`**; `fetchpriority="high"` only for true LCP; lazy below fold; serve modern formats appropriately.

## Fonts

Cap families / weights; **`font-display: swap`**; subset when possible.

## Motion

Compositor-friendly transforms/opacity (see **`web/coding-style`**); remove **`will-change`** after transitions; **`IntersectionObserver`** over scroll spam.